  "title": "People get so defensive about climate change the second it’s brought ...",
  "description": "People get so defensive about climate change the second it’s brought up. Then often just block out whatever else someone says. If people just listened to the other point of view and hear why people share differing opinions on the topic I think a lot of people could be better informed and form their own conclusion. But it’s almost like a religion to some people and their whole purpose, so that makes it impossible to offer differing thoughts. Maybe paying more money in taxes for our government to literally lower the tempersture of the Earth while they can’t manage a budget isn’t the answer. Meanwhile the worlds biggest polluters do business as usual.  - #tuckercarlson #politics #climatechange ",
